From dacb8b0169153d017d68fac988ccb26863880a0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PabloBenario <pablo.benario@ug.uchile.cl>
Date: Sat, 2 May 2026 20:15:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] Show all failure boxes, not just the first

pp_suite_errors ~show_all:false only renders the first error box when
running without --verbose or --show-errors. For the incremental PBT use
case, each failing test that also has incomplete cases embeds its stats
in its failure message, so suppressing all but the first box hides the
per-test incomplete breakdown.

Change show_all to true so every error box is always rendered. This is
consistent with --show-errors behaviour and does not change the log-file
output.

